  "gameData": {
    "backstory": "Orphaned at a young age, growing up in the school of hard knocks of Street Yay Blvd, 'Grimfeather' learned to survive by his wits and his blade. He lost his flock to a DRIP raid gone wrong, now he wanders Subchain City, seeking revenge and a glimmer of hope.",
    "class": "Ronin",
    "name": "Grimfeather",
    "personality": "Grimfeather is haunted by his past, giving him a stoic and brooding demeanor. He's fiercely loyal to those few he trusts, but quick to draw his Quilcutter on anyone he suspects of treachery. Deep down, he yearns for a better world, but he's convinced it's a fool's dream, so, as they say, 'fake it till you make it'.",
    "specialAbility": {
      "description": "Draws upon his rage and sorrow to unleash a flurry of strikes, dealing massive damage to a single target. Grimfeather's Quillcutter becomes a blur, capable of slicing through even the toughest Featherguard armor.",
